---
import { sitePath } from '../lib/sitePath';
const principles=[['Simplicity','Keep the next action clear and reduce unnecessary friction in the customer journey.'],['Hospitality','Use technology to support service, not to erase the human experience around it.'],['Adaptability','Configure the system around the operation and its verified requirements.'],['Clarity','Describe capabilities, compatibility, pricing, and implementation scope without unsupported promises.']];
---
<section class="home-about section-shell" id="about-us" data-section-target aria-labelledby="about-title" data-reveal>
  <div class="home-about-intro"><span class="eyebrow">About Us</span><h2 id="about-title">Simple for customers.<br />Adaptable for business.</h2>
    <p>Ez Kyosk brings the customer-facing order and the operational flow closer together, without making the experience feel complicated.</p>
    <p>Ez Kyosk is self-ordering and checkout kiosk software for businesses that want a clearer path from customer choice to operational action.</p>
    <p>Self-ordering, checkout, payments and order tracking connect the customer journey. Automated inventory, reports, analytics, customer tools, loyalty and promotions can be configured to client requirements and agreed in the quotation.</p>
    <p>Hospitality and food are the initial focus, with room to support retail, wellness, beauty, service, B2B, and other suitable markets.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="value-grid">{principles.map(([title,body])=><article><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></article>)}</div>
  <p class="home-about-intro"><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/contact/')}>Discuss your requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
</section>
